    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "...We should stuff him into a sack..."
    },
    {
        "text": "...and hang him on the mast at dawn..."
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...We should slit his throat..."
    },
    {
        "text": "...and offer him to the ocean as a tribute to the raging hurricane..."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$darkness01_intro",
        "key": "$darkness01_loop",
        "volume": 0.8,
        "crossfade": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_infirmary",
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_143_ghost"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ugh!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Specter"
    },
    {
        "text": "...that same dream again.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Specter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_263_skadi#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_143_ghost"
    },
    {
        "text": "Who is it?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Specter"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Oh, it's just you. Hm, I can't even seem to remember your name.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Specter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_263_skadi#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "That doesn't matter. Just treat me like any normal Rhodes Island operator.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "text": "You look like you're in pain.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_143_ghost"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's just another nightmare.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Specter"
    },
    {
        "text": "Dark fragments swirling in my consciousness, hidden beneath the shadows of that broken church...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Specter"
    },
    {
        "text": "When I approach them, they turn into shackles and drag me down into the deep sea.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Specter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_263_skadi#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "text": "But soon, there will be a way to escape your torment.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_143_ghost"
    },
    {
        "text": "Heh, is that so? That'd be great. But why should I trust you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Specter"
    },
    {
        "text": "Heh.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Specter"
    },
    {
        "text": "Your aura... I'm quite familiar with it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Specter"
    },
    {
        "text": "No, it's your smell. It's an intense, pungent smell... the smell of blood... 'their' smell. The smell of the deep sea.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Specter"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's a familiar and abhorrent smell.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Specter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_263_skadi#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Is that so?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_143_ghost"
    },
    {
        "text": "Can you tell me your name?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Specter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_263_skadi#1",
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Skadi.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skadi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_143_ghost",
        "name2": "char_263_skadi#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Interesting. So, why did you decide to show up here?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Specter"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're not supposed to be here without permission from Kal'tsit, unless you're not afraid of me ripping you to pieces.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Specter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_143_ghost",
        "name2": "char_263_skadi#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I am afraid. Just like everyone else. However, I'm used to fear.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skadi"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's time to go. By the time I come back, things may have already moved forward. However, you can forget all about me, just like before.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skadi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_143_ghost",
        "name2": "char_263_skadi#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Where are you going?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Specter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_143_ghost",
        "name2": "char_263_skadi#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "To where the secret is buried.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skadi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "A place far, far away from you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skadi"
    },
